{"id":"bf7f9072-ebe7-426f-b832-daa1f3ef50ae","expr":"minCapacity >= 0","rationale":"The method throws a RuntimeException if minCapacity is negative, so at method entry minCapacity should be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#resizeBuffer(int):void","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:46.778456777Z"}
{"id":"2b9c6946-1255-4e27-8f8e-263bc3693416","expr":"newSize >= 0","rationale":"The method checks newSize is non-negative and throws if not, so newSize is always >= 0 at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#truncate(int):void","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:47.210458838Z"}
{"id":"ee472b20-10ec-4bec-be84-b55b6df9536e","expr":"minCapacity >= 0","rationale":"The method throws an exception if minCapacity < 0, so at method exit minCapacity must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#resizeBuffer(int):void","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:47.280047281Z"}
{"id":"b8906984-825f-4094-9955-82dd6e6f16f3","expr":"value == true || value == false","rationale":"The 'value' parameter is a boolean and can only be true or false.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(boolean):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:47.432891862Z"}
