{"id":"bef51e4b-4328-420c-92d4-7af0be9a27a2","expr":"Character.isDefined(value)","rationale":"The appended char is expected to be a valid defined character in Unicode.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:50.031421072Z"}
{"id":"086d444c-3884-4b7e-909a-8a7d47f12ca9","expr":"value >= 0","rationale":"Char values are basically 16-bit unsigned integral types, so value is always >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:50.031421072Z"}
{"id":"b571b0d5-89cd-4ff3-b393-f1711196990f","expr":"value <= Character.MAX_VALUE","rationale":"Value must be less or equal to max char value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:50.031421072Z"}
{"id":"812454cb-cb7a-465c-8050-66ec9d20b906","expr":"ch == null || ch.length >= 0","rationale":"Array length is always non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char[]):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:50.556808059Z"}
{"id":"dd66e98b-59d8-491f-9c86-f12a6f7af656","expr":"ch != null || ch == null","rationale":"The parameter ch can be either null or not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char[]):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:50.556808059Z"}
{"id":"039ad08d-7d39-4e1d-a0d8-f123690526c0","expr":"ch == null || ch.length > 0 || ch.length == 0","rationale":"Length is zero or positive, reflecting valid arrays.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char[]):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:50.556808059Z"}
{"id":"e891b206-3a23-4103-afef-b71d5ffef1c6","expr":"ch == null || (start >= 0 && start <= ch.length)","rationale":"If ch is null, start is irrelevant; otherwise, start must be within valid range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:52.381131281Z"}
{"id":"b2c5fe3a-42a2-40a0-aebf-a08752b732bd","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"Invalid negative length would cause exception.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:52.381131281Z"}
{"id":"38ff1a7b-b089-4c60-a892-aafdd231aa9b","expr":"ch == null || start + length <= ch.length","rationale":"Prevent overflow when appending a slice of ch.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:52.381131281Z"}
{"id":"6a11b100-7173-42d5-8561-0c5434507b9b","expr":"length == 0 || length > 0","rationale":"Express length relational boundary conditions relevant to the code behavior.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:52.381131281Z"}
{"id":"a601bc38-aa21-40d5-984d-4ada93e3a0d7","expr":"ch != null || (start == 0 && length == 0)","rationale":"When ch is null, start and length are likely unused or zero.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:52.381131281Z"}
{"id":"b865dab4-ef3c-48bb-9c6c-b5d1e8240c2c","expr":"ch == null || (result.items.length >= result.size)","rationale":"Backing array length is always at least as large as size.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char[]):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:52.739700142Z"}
{"id":"f6e94836-2677-492c-b6a6-e1527c309b14","expr":"str == null || str.length() >= 0","rationale":"When str is non-null, its length must be zero or positive.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:53.728760587Z"}
{"id":"b10eab6e-7440-4c13-ac3c-0f64879e59c8","expr":"! (str != null && str.length() < 0)","rationale":"Ensures that if str is not null, str.length() cannot be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:53.728760587Z"}
{"id":"fe8a03e5-1257-4159-b1db-95122c04a160","expr":"str == null || str.position() <= str.limit()","rationale":"Buffer's position must not exceed its limit, when buffer is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:53.728760587Z"}
{"id":"18c3a025-68d3-4a45-9b9d-adc5490cd10f","expr":"str == null || str.capacity() >= str.limit()","rationale":"Ensures the buffer capacity is at least the limit for any non-null buffer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:53.728760587Z"}
{"id":"caa8e076-2a48-4473-bc47-984ff879be44","expr":"str == null || str.isReadOnly() == false","rationale":"Invokes isReadOnly() if available, to check buffer can be appended if not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:53.728760587Z"}
{"id":"5aeefe10-af13-4ecb-8edf-988f286e308e","expr":"ch == null || length == 0 || result.size >= length","rationale":"If ch is not null and length > 0, the appended length must be accounted in result's size.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:54.291462199Z"}
{"id":"b442c628-9121-4a76-bda0-04d3e2407e41","expr":"str == null || result.size >= str.remaining()","rationale":"Appending str adds its remaining characters to the CharArray size or calls appendNull.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:54.429798075Z"}
{"id":"e39ed974-1c55-4fa5-9c65-9b7d5e765abc","expr":"buf == null || (start >= 0 && end >= 0 && start <= end && end <= buf.remaining())","rationale":"If the buffer is not null, start and end must specify a valid range within the remaining characters of buf.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:54.965721930Z"}
{"id":"a3a8296b-f649-4234-adb6-8b4c53198c98","expr":"buf == null || buf.hasArray() || end <= buf.remaining()","rationale":"If buf is non-null and does not have an accessible backing array, we still expect end to be within the valid range.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:54.965721930Z"}
{"id":"dde2ae15-b41b-4a5f-904c-9b56787fb090","expr":"start <= end","rationale":"Start index should not be greater than end index when specifying a subsequence.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:54.965721930Z"}
{"id":"01332c30-c739-4176-931b-b4164ef43381","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"Start index must be non-negative as it represents a position in the buffer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:54.965721930Z"}
{"id":"c3e71598-eb5c-4f3a-8541-b419e309b72d","expr":"end >= 0","rationale":"End index must be non-negative as it represents a position in the buffer.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:54.965721930Z"}
{"id":"fe514e93-cede-4741-b567-7dfe6a251802","expr":"result.size > 0","rationale":"Since the method appends one char and increments size, size should be positive at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:55.120125629Z"}
{"id":"6094f73f-6f43-4883-9ee6-d96401951f7c","expr":"result.items[result.size - 1] == value","rationale":"The method appends value at items[size++] so the last element is value.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:55.120125629Z"}
{"id":"840b9dab-2967-463c-a4e0-96673a395cc2","expr":"seq == null || seq.length() >= 0","rationale":"Seq is either null or has a non-negative length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:56.636272132Z"}
{"id":"ebaa9742-10e3-413d-bb07-8cc3340e862a","expr":"seq == null || seq.toString() != null","rationale":"If seq is non-null, calling toString() yields a non-null String.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:56.636272132Z"}
{"id":"491297ec-0056-445b-a94c-6b954bf293dd","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The returned CharArray instance 'result' should never be null as the method returns 'this' or the result of appendNull() which is also expected non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharBuffer,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:56.969341415Z"}
{"id":"7a5d3687-8ebc-45c1-9233-f1b12df98db5","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns a CharArray instance or throws, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:57.916191678Z"}
{"id":"98acc0af-c9e7-4779-a017-e0663ff0cd3b","expr":"seq == null || (result.length >= end - start)","rationale":"If seq is non-null, the appended part has length end - start, so result should have length at least that much appended.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:57.916191678Z"}
{"id":"e805168c-c1b5-42ea-802f-afa4a71f6150","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method always returns an instance of CharArray, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:57.938952675Z"}
{"id":"10c9d77c-e9a7-476f-8b00-87e2ff0fdb7b","expr":"!(seq == null && result.size < 1)","rationale":"Appending null does not reduce the size of CharArray.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:57.938952675Z"}
{"id":"a0cc3e54-0601-4fb5-bc09-bbe04a26cfc1","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"The method throws if start is negative, so start >= 0 is a required invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.449996209Z"}
{"id":"8e3eccb6-df54-48df-8db3-ff85246c0491","expr":"end >= 0","rationale":"The method throws if end is negative, so end >= 0 is an invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.449996209Z"}
{"id":"fe8e4284-1c8a-4ac1-81ab-245eab85f735","expr":"end <= (seq == null ? 0 : seq.length())","rationale":"The method throws if end is greater than seq.length(). For null seq, this cannot be checked safely, so guarded by seq != null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.449996209Z"}
{"id":"7d95c75d-6090-452c-9a4d-74878b8d8cf2","expr":"start <= end","rationale":"The method throws if start > end, so start <= end holds as an invariant.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.449996209Z"}
{"id":"045f8f37-ada0-4795-8877-b2f1f35cca19","expr":"seq == null || seq.length() >= 0","rationale":"By definition CharSequence length is non-negative if seq is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(CharSequence,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.449996209Z"}
{"id":"ff7b7fa8-2b74-4b5f-a810-9c7b96a5d143","expr":"result != null && result.items.length >= result.size","rationale":"The internal buffer array length should accommodate all current characters.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.544014471Z"}
{"id":"22ffc652-6c24-47ea-8aa9-29d5397901b2","expr":"result.items != null","rationale":"The character array inside result should be initialized.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.544014471Z"}
{"id":"bd14777f-d7e7-49ba-8ef1-e673aefc6710","expr":"result.size > 0","rationale":"Appending a string representation of a double adds characters, so size is positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.544014471Z"}
{"id":"dd0f0564-ad2f-4bc5-9946-87105874c313","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns 'result', which should never be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.544014471Z"}
{"id":"e9444b04-664c-45e4-a460-fe44cdd3a3d1","expr":"Double.isFinite(value) || Double.isNaN(value) || value == Double.POSITIVE_INFINITY || value == Double.NEGATIVE_INFINITY","rationale":"The double value can be a finite number, NaN, or infinity, as supported by String.valueOf.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.938370519Z"}
{"id":"78bdea32-4dda-4a49-a47e-e72efce4c2a7","expr":"Double.MIN_VALUE <= Math.abs(value) || value == 0.0","rationale":"The absolute value of the double is either zero or at least the minimum positive double value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.938370519Z"}
{"id":"85d0b7a9-c83e-417b-94d3-a78a5af18edb","expr":"value == 0.0 || value != 0.0","rationale":"Value is either zero or non-zero, covering double domain.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.938370519Z"}
{"id":"cdf559c6-366d-433b-b2e5-4e3886620507","expr":"value <= Double.MAX_VALUE","rationale":"Value cannot exceed the maximum double value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.938370519Z"}
{"id":"92da5674-0893-432b-a8a7-f1270c86064c","expr":"value >= -Double.MAX_VALUE","rationale":"Value cannot be less than the negation of the maximum double value.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:58.938370519Z"}
{"id":"6f755862-33f1-4eee-9afc-fa5b96b1e091","expr":"minLength >= 0","rationale":"minLength should be non-negative as it represents a minimum length parameter.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:43:59.943665360Z"}
{"id":"631d7e26-99a5-4d4b-90f3-5ed075df35e7","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns this CharArray instance after appending the float value, so result is non-null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(float):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:00.812985825Z"}
{"id":"25bb6591-2937-4648-a968-13cc1b8a69c7","expr":"result.size >= 0","rationale":"The size field of CharArray cannot be negative, so result.size >= 0.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(float):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:00.812985825Z"}
{"id":"30641b96-d55d-4363-af96-e44429ee9fac","expr":"result.size > 0","rationale":"Appending the string form of a float adds characters, so the size after append is positive.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(float):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:00.812985825Z"}
{"id":"b9b6f7c5-fd43-438d-82aa-fc8e726e0482","expr":"minLength >= 0","rationale":"minLength represents a length, which is generally non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(int,int,char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:01.607445242Z"}
{"id":"c106d5da-a3f8-4842-b29b-a5ddf24863ee","expr":"prefix >= 0","rationale":"The prefix is a char, which when treated as an int, is between 0 and 65535.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#append(int,int,char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:01.607445242Z"}
