{"id":"9db3e173-ab3d-4012-accc-36dbb96f4490","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns a CharArray object which is likely the same as or a modified version of 'this', hence non-null","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#appendln(StringBuilder):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:43.671280223Z"}
