{"id":"08a4fc4a-ca13-48f8-b748-0e06e45c665e","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The result represents the CharArray returned by the method, which is the object on which append and appendLine are called.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#appendln(StringBuilder,int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:44.798548462Z"}
