{"id":"66e443f2-daef-4bfc-b9e6-5b240a563902","expr":"Character.isDefined(defaultIfEmpty)","rationale":"Similar reasoning as for standard separator character.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#appendSeparator(char,char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:54.370829694Z"}
{"id":"03c7e00f-ffc9-41fc-8f5c-72598ea7431a","expr":"standard != '\\0'","rationale":"Typically a separator character should be visible and not null.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#appendSeparator(char,char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:54.370829694Z"}
{"id":"fe9cf7c5-bf29-4b89-b08c-2235cb92a1ea","expr":"defaultIfEmpty != '\\0'","rationale":"Similar reasoning as for standard separator character.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#appendSeparator(char,char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:54.370829694Z"}
{"id":"80bf1c70-6bd5-4062-9523-835af0f2bb46","expr":"result.size > 0","rationale":"After appending one character, the CharArray size must be greater than zero.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#appendSeparator(char,char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:55.395668178Z"}
{"id":"f70bc125-53e1-49c1-ae3c-9a5a2b4a508d","expr":"(!result.isEmpty() && result.get(result.size - 1) == standard) || (result.isEmpty() && false)","rationale":"If original CharArray was not empty, the last appended char is standard; if it was empty, defaultIfEmpty was appended.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#appendSeparator(char,char):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:55.395668178Z"}
