{"id":"623d6c2d-cef3-4be2-90f3-6eeee9e74fe8","expr":"loopIndex >= 0","rationale":"Loop indexes typically start at 0 or a positive integer, never negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#appendSeparator(char,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:44:55.575019868Z"}
