{"id":"a3245e96-82d4-4519-b148-d84ca67eb735","expr":"start >= 0","rationale":"The method sets start = Math.max(0, start), so start is always >= 0 when the method begins.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#indexOf(char,int):int","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:31.286173884Z"}
