{"id":"fb854f2e-ae7b-4340-99e6-1ae86aff7528","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"Index is validated by validateIndex, so index is non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char):void","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:31.826922842Z"}
{"id":"0de1da46-4a81-46df-aa5e-52fcd9aa749a","expr":"str != null","rationale":"Since the method searches for a string, the string parameter should not be null to avoid NullPointerException during the search.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#indexOf(String):int","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:32.108210470Z"}
