{"id":"12f9d6a1-3fdf-46aa-8628-51f8cce0a9b3","expr":"str.length() >= 0","rationale":"This is a basic property of strings and helps in understanding boundary conditions.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#indexOf(String,int):int","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:34.468994781Z"}
{"id":"db919145-a6f1-4151-bae0-7dd347340759","expr":"start < Integer.MAX_VALUE","rationale":"No meaningful start can be beyond Integer.MAX_VALUE - helpful as trivial domain bound.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#indexOf(String,int):int","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:34.468994781Z"}
{"id":"cbae2157-55cb-49e0-a969-b3bb9e70a1a0","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The method returns 'this', so the result cannot be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,boolean):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:34.698882380Z"}
