{"id":"47350adb-f20e-48b1-a992-c05fb8476d46","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"The method throws IndexOutOfBoundsException if the index is invalid. Since the index is used for insertion, it must be at least 0","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,boolean):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:34.850845699Z"}
{"id":"9d2e8fb8-376e-4298-8d1b-01c82d9dbfca","expr":"(value == true) || (value == false)","rationale":"The value parameter is boolean, so it can only be true or false","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,boolean):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:34.850845699Z"}
