{"id":"afc9d792-994b-40d7-bf5d-e805ab480008","expr":"count >= 0","rationale":"The method specifies inserting a non-negative number of items.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insertRange(int,int):void","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:34.883737814Z"}
{"id":"d69151c1-ff49-4165-8e3c-1f7da434ef7c","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"The method validateIndex(index) is called before any operation, so index must be within valid range (non-negative).","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char[]):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:36.591358830Z"}
{"id":"8eec2e76-bca1-4dd1-8e07-dbc26c76ca84","expr":"! (ch != null && ch.length == 0)","rationale":"If ch is non-null, its length is either 0 or more; the method behaves differently if length > 0.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char[]):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:36.591358830Z"}
