{"id":"bcc447e2-d7a5-4a25-b93a-0996247a5eae","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"Index must be non-negative to be valid for insertion.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,float):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:38.272566602Z"}
{"id":"5c438007-1066-42e7-aa6c-fc2eb069ca71","expr":"index >= 0","rationale":"The index must be within valid bounds for insertion, so non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:38.609944999Z"}
{"id":"05228c2d-1481-4042-9c92-5a3d595a010a","expr":"offset >= 0","rationale":"The offset within the character array must not be negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:38.609944999Z"}
{"id":"7542c5d5-144f-4c65-abfe-f19d303a1676","expr":"ch == null || offset <= ch.length","rationale":"If the char array is not null, offset cannot exceed its length.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:38.609944999Z"}
{"id":"b01d331e-895c-4eb3-96eb-66ee7e0589b6","expr":"length >= 0","rationale":"The length of the subarray must be non-negative.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:38.609944999Z"}
{"id":"c8c51443-649b-44fe-855e-5d440f36d7d1","expr":"ch == null || offset + length <= ch.length","rationale":"The sum of offset and length cannot exceed the character array length if it exists.","kind":"METHOD_ENTRY","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char[],int,int):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:38.609944999Z"}
{"id":"9ea1fa21-69ba-4d82-89da-a829aee9804b","expr":"result != null","rationale":"Since the method returns 'this', result should not be null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char[]):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:39.199080385Z"}
{"id":"eaff808d-7ef3-4541-801e-e7470a70841c","expr":"index >= 0 && index <= result.size","rationale":"The method calls validateIndex(index) which throws exception if index invalid, so index is valid at exit.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char[]):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:39.199080385Z"}
