{"id":"270f73de-2c04-490e-99e1-b7608b6acef9","expr":"ch == null || result != null","rationale":"Regardless of whether ch is null, result must be non-null since method returns this.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,char[]):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:39.199080385Z"}
{"id":"e7fe9487-3cf1-4ca7-9211-bda63cd9ad48","expr":"result != null","rationale":"The insert method is expected to return a CharArray instance, most likely the same object on which the method was called or a modified copy, so result is not null.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:39.853975134Z"}
{"id":"6b42a454-102f-455c-9014-7d81c98b26e3","expr":"index <= result.size","rationale":"For insertions, the index must be less than or equal to the size of the CharArray to place the value correctly; otherwise, an exception would be thrown.","kind":"METHOD_EXIT","element":"com.badlogic.gdx.utils.CharArray#insert(int,double):CharArray","file":"com/badlogic/gdx/utils/CharArray.java","createdAt":"2026-09-10T05:45:39.853975134Z"}
